super-v-ubuntu (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add GNOME Shell 50 API compatibility for Ubuntu 26.04 Wayland.
  * Use current widget orientation, stage event actors and stage context seat.
  * Handle GNOME 46's unfocused stage correctly when checking paste focus.
  * Add compatibility regression checks and retain explicit runtime status.

